Workflow:

Data Ingestion: Acquired and loaded raw physical sensor data from the radar hardware into MATLAB.

Pre-Processing: Applied signal filtering techniques to remove environmental noise and isolate the target frequencies.

Spectral Analysis: Executed Fast Fourier Transforms (FFT) to transition the data into the spectral domain.

Visualization: Generated automated Range-Doppler maps to visually identify the exact distance, velocity, and signal strength of the detected targets.
